T1  - A case study exploring therapeutic communication as a mechanism for delivery of integrated care management (icm) by home healthcare (hhc) nurses.
JF  - International Journal of Integrated Care (IJIC)
A1  - Liebel Dianne
A1  - Powers Bethel
