AB  - The article reports on the findings of a study concerning alcohol use among young adults attending college. Results showed that almost half of college-aged individuals meet the criteria for substance abuse, personality disorders or another mental health problem. Only one-fourth of the group seeks treatment. The study concludes that urgent action is needed to improve detection and treatment in youth.
