T1  - Reducing depression during the menopausal transition: study protocol for a randomised controlled trial
JF  - TRIALS
A1  - Almeida OP
A1  - Marsh K
A1  - Flicker L
A1  - Hickey M
A1  - Ford A
A1  - Sim M
