re was no statistical difference between the groups. The rate of treatment discontinuation was similar between the TEAT (44%) and SEAT (43.7%) groups (p > 0.05). The rates of adverse events were not similar too. Conclusion: This study showed that both TEAT and SEAT have similar efficacy and safety profiles in patients with ND. (PsycINFO Database Record (c) 2018 APA, all rights reserved)
