T1  - Effects of a remotely delivered group-format epilepsy self-management program on adverse health outcomes in vulnerable people with epilepsy: A causal mediation analysis.
JF  - Epilepsy Research
A1  - Briggs Farren B.S
A1  - Wilson Betsy K
A1  - Pyatka Nataliya
A1  - Colón-Zimmermann Kari
A1  - Sajatovic Martha M
KW  - eppi-reviewer
