T1  - Physical health behaviours and health locus of control in people with schizophrenia-spectrum disorder and bipolar disorder: a cross-sectional comparative study with people with non-psychotic mental illness
JF  - BMC PSYCHIATRY
A1  - Buhagiar K
A1  - Parsonage L
A1  - Osborn DPJ
