T1  - Exploring the impact of a complex intervention for women with depression in contexts of adversity: A pilot feasibility study of COURRAGE-plus in South Africa
JF  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF SOCIAL PSYCHIATRY
A1  - Burgess RA
A1  - Jeske N
A1  - Rasool S
A1  - Ahmad A
A1  - Kydd A
