AB  - This article looks into a community-based approach in India, called Camp Approach, for treating substance dependence. The approach calls for the selection of a specific geographic area based on the known need. The focus of treatment is detoxification and relapse prevention through community support. Using the Camp Approach has encouraging results. However, there is still a need to rigorously evaluate its utility and effectiveness, as well as other community-based interventions in both India and the West.
