T1  - Patient Risk Factors Do Not Impact 90-Day Readmission and Emergency Department Visitation After Total Ankle Arthroplasty Implications for the Comprehensive Care for Joint Replacement (CJR) Bundled Payment Plan
JF  - JOURNAL OF BONE AND JOINT SURGERY-AMERICAN VOLUME
A1  - Cunningham D
A1  - Karas V
