T1  - Head-to-head comparison of 1-year aripiprazole long-acting injectable (LAI) versus paliperidone LAI in comorbid psychosis and substance use disorder: impact on clinical status, substance craving, and quality of life
JF  - NEUROPSYCHIATRIC DISEASE AND TREATMENT
A1  - Cuomo I
